# PR hygiene (always on)

Canonical policy: [`docs/agent-efficiency/pr-review-cost-efficiency.md`](../../docs/agent-efficiency/pr-review-cost-efficiency.md) · [`autonomous-pr-policy.md`](../../docs/agent-efficiency/autonomous-pr-policy.md)

## Pre-PR critical self-review (mandatory — every PR)

**Before** the first push that opens a PR, and **before** every behavior-changing PR update, perform a **critical self-review** of the full diff. Applies to all agent work including execute-plan workers.

Checklist (full text): pr-review-cost-efficiency.md §Pre-PR critical self-review. Documentation: `.cursor/rules/documentation.mdc` + `/canonical-docs sync` when behaviour changes. Verification: `./scripts/pre-push-changed.sh` after adjustments.

Only after this review passes: commit, push, create/update the PR.

## Automatic review (Copilot-first)

- **Primary:** GitHub **Copilot** PR review when enabled — triage when threads exist.
- **Collect:** `node scripts/babysit_pr_reviews.js collect --pr <url>` — triage Copilot + human threads (autonomous-pr-policy §Automatic reviews).
- **Autofix:** Off — babysit+ owns fixes.

## Model for PR babysitting

See pr-review-cost-efficiency.md §Cloud Agent model policy. During active execute-plan (gate `0`), do not end the turn for model mismatch alone — autonomous-pr-policy §Execute-plan overrides.
